 "notes": [
  "data/code/train.bin rebuilt today is 226,402,819 bytes (sha256 24c41255...) instead of the recorded 147,802,575: packages (transformers, tokenizers, matplotlib, ...) were installed into the .venv after the corpus was built on 2026-10-17. val.bin and both test files rebuild byte-identically. The recorded train.bin is the one the code models were trained on; do not rebuild it with --force.",
  "simdjson's jsonexamples/ was moved to simdjson/simdjson-data after v0.9.x; pinned to tag v0.9.7 (commit 33d926bd), the last tag with the full directory. Each JSON/log download is checked against its git blob id at the pinned commit as well as its SHA-256.",
  "loghub is research/academic-use only: not redistributable by jevzip; text8/enwik8 are Wikipedia (CC BY-SA/GFDL); Silesia states no license.",
  "text8.zip and silesia.zip have no published checksums; their SHA-256s were recorded on first download (2026-10-18)."
 ]
